mary-fixed\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">mode_fan<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div>\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Pillar I \\u2022 Climate Engineering<\\/span>\\n<h3 class=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-bold\\\">Air Conditioning Supply &amp; Professional Installation<\\/h3>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              Every installation follows stringent factory standards. We eliminate the leading cause of early compressor failure\\u2014improper evacuation and poor pipe flaring\\u2014through our certified MEP protocols.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"space-y-space-xs pt-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-space-xs p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\\">verified_user<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"text-body-sm text-on-surface\\\">\\n<strong>TESDA NC-II RAC Certified Technicians:<\\/strong> Factory-trained crew with specialized copper brazing and manifold digital gauge testing.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-space-xs p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\\">speed<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"text-body-sm text-on-surface\\\">\\n<strong>Deep Micron Vacuum &amp; Nitrogen Leak Test:<\\/strong> We pull down to &lt;500 microns to guarantee zero moisture contamination in your refrigerant lines.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-space-xs p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\\">handshake<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"text-body-sm text-on-surface\\\">\\n<strong>10-Foot Free Heavy Copper Package:<\\/strong> Includes branded gauge 22 insulated copper piping, metal brackets, circuit breaker, and outdoor mount.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-space-xs p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\\">schedule<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"text-body-sm text-on-surface\\\">\\n<strong>Preventive Maintenance Contracts (PMS):<\\/strong> Quarterly chemical foam coil cleanings and thermodynamic inspection for commercial complexes.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Free On-Site Survey Across North Luzon<\\/span>\\n<a class=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-2 rounded bg-primary text-on-primary font-title-md text-body-md font-semibold hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/canriv.free.nf\\/index.php\\/contact\\/\\\">\\n<span>Book Aircon Survey<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">chevron_right<\\/span>\\n<\\/a>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"space-y-space-sm\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\"><span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">elevator<\\/span><\\/div>\\n<div><span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Pillar II \\u2022 Vertical Transport<\\/span><h3 class=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-bold\\\">Elevator Systems &amp; Hoistway Erection<\\/h3><\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\\\">Canriv supplies and installs passenger, freight, and hospital elevators for residential, commercial, and industrial projects. Share your building plans so the team can di