dy-md text-surface-dim leading-relaxed\\\">Expanding North Luzon logistics centers and service hubs across Central Luzon, Metro Manila, and nationwide to supply genuine energy-saving inverter air conditioning units and certified safe passenger lifts backed by 24\\/7 service response.<\\/p><\\/div><div class=\\\"mt-space-lg pt-space-md flex items-center gap-space-lg font-label-code text-label-sm text-surface-dim\\/70\\\"><span>NATIONWIDE HUBS<\\/span><span>\\u2022<\\/span><span>24\\/7 ELEVATOR &amp; AC SUPPORT<\\/span><\\/div><\\/div><\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"mb-space-md text-center max-w-xl mx-auto\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-semibold\\\">The Unbending Standard<\\/span>\\n<h2 class=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface uppercase mt-1\\\">Core Operational Values<\\/h2>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col\\\"><div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-space-md\\\"><span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">verified_user<\\/span><\\/div><h4 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase mb-space-xs\\\">Authorized Dealership<\\/h4><p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant flex-1 mb-space-md\\\">Direct authorized partner for global air conditioner and elevator brands. Every unit is supplied with full factory warranties, genuine OEM replacement parts, and certified mechanical documentation.<\\/p><div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-low p-space-sm rounded font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"><span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">verified<\\/span><span>100% Genuine OEM Units &amp; Parts<\\/span><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-spac