nded-lg\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline\\\">Pressure Hold<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface\\\">600 PSI<\\/div>\\n<span class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary\\\">Certified 48-Hr N\\u2082 Test<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-space-sm bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline\\\">Guaranteed SLA<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary\\\">4-Hour<\\/div>\\n<span class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary\\\">Technical BOQ Reply<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-space-xs text-on-surface font-body-sm text-body-sm\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[18px]\\\">verified<\\/span>\\n<span>Accredited with PS Mark &amp; DOE Energy Star 5-Star Ratings<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"59a5ac5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Four Primary HVAC & Ventilation Domains\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":0,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0334b86\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Four Primary HVAC & Ventilation Domains\",\"html\":\"<div id=\\\"catalog-categories\\\">%%CANRIV:vertical-transport%%<\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[]}]},{\"id\":\"0954cd8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Full Lifecycle Mechanical Contracting\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":0,\"right\":0,\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"94b449d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"isInner\":false,\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Full Lifecycle Mechanical Contracting\",\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"bg-surface text-on-surface font-body-md antialiased\\\"><section class=\\\"w-full py-space-xl bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin flex flex-col gap-space-xl\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs max-w-2xl\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary font-semibold\\\">Contractor Lifecycle Capabilities<\\/span>\\n<h2 class=\\\"font-display text-headline-lg text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight\\\">Full Lifecycle Mechanical Contracting<\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n          We go beyond equipment supply. Our registered Philippine Professional Mechanical Engineers (PME) handle the complete project horizon from blueprints to commission handovers.\\n        <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">calculate<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline uppercase font-semibold\\\">Service 01<\\/span>\\n<h3 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase\\\">Heat Load Calculations &amp; Sizing<\\/h3>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              ASHRAE standard psychrometric calculations accounting for building envelope thermal coefficients (U-values), solar heat gain coefficients (SHGC), and Philippine occupancy loads to eliminate costly oversizing.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-md font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n<span>Manual J \\/ S \\/ D Protocol<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">check_circle<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">handyman<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline uppercase font-semibold\\\">Service 02<\\/span>\\n<h3 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase\\\">Certified Installation &amp; N\\u2082 Pressure Test<\\/h3>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              Rigorous brazing with continuous nitrogen purging. Every copper line is subjected to a mandatory 48-hour 600 PSI nitrogen holding test before triple evacuation below 500 microns.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-md font-label-code text-label-sm text-tertiary font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n<span>DOLE-OSHC Safety Certified<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">check_circle<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">published_with_changes<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline uppercase font-semibold\\\">Service 03<\\/span>\\n<h3 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase\\\">Quarterly Maintenance Agreements (PMA)<\\/h3>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              Scheduled non-acidic coil chemical washing, compressor vibration analysis, megger insulation breakdown testing, operating superheat &amp; subcooling logging, and computerized asset health reporting.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-md font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n<span>Predictive CMMS Tracking<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">check_circle<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[28px]\\\">description<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-outline uppercase font-semibold\\\">Service 04<\\/span>\\n<h3 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface uppercase\\\">B2B Submittals &amp; PCAB Permitting<\\/h3>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              Full mechanical shop drawings (AutoCAD \\/ Revit BIM), as-built blueprints signed and sealed by registered PMEs, DPWH\\/LGU mechanical permit processing, and BFP fire safety inspection support.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-md font-label-code text-label-sm text-tertiary font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n<span>PME Signed &amp; Sealed<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">check_circle<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\