n-surface\\/90 mt-1\\\">\\n                  1,800 sqm centralized warehouse storing genuine OEM compressors, inverter PC boards, and elevator guide rails.\\n                <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center pt-2\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">3<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Service Depots<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">48+<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">RAC Certified Techs<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">&lt;4h<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Commercial SLA<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"space-y-space-xs\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm uppercase font-bold text-primary tracking-wider\\\">REGIONAL ADVANTAGE<\\/span>\\n<h2 class=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface uppercase font-bold\\\">\\n              WHY CONTRACTORS &amp; ENTERPRISES CHOOSE CANRIV IN NORTH LUZON\\n            <\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              Unlike Manila-based contractors who charge heavy mobilization fees and incur days of response delays, Canriv-J Corporation maintains permanent warehousing, fleet vans, and rigging engineers directly in Central &amp; North Luzon.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"p-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm space-y-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded bg-primary-fixed\\/50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">store<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h4 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">Direct Authorized Dealer<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n                Zero third-party markups. Factory warranty backed directly by Carrier, Daikin, Koppel, and Canriv corporate lines. Genuine OEM components only.\\n              <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm space-y-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded bg-primary-fixed\\/50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">badge<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h4 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">TESDA NC-II &amp; Certified Riggers<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n                Every team leader is a licensed mechanical or electrical practitioner with formal refrigeration credentials. High-altitude and mountain rigging qualified.\\n              <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm space-y-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded bg-primary-fixed\\/50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">policy<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h4 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">DOLE, PCAB &amp; Code Compliance<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n                We handle the complete mechanical permitting lifecycle: signing and sealing by Professional Mechanical Engineers (PME) for elevators and VRF chillers.\\n              <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm space-y-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded bg-primary-fixed\\/50 flex items-center justify-center text-primary\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">support_agent<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<h4 class=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">24\\/7 Rapid Response Network<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n                Dedicated rapid-dispatch vans located in San Fernando (Pampanga), Baguio City (Benguet), and Balintawak (NCR border) for immediate breakdown recovery.\\n              <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-63dfd0f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"63dfd0f\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab58223 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"ab58223\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bg-surface text-on-surface font-body-md antialiased\\\"><section class=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-gutter\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-space-lg lg:p-space-xl shadow-md relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-center\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-space-sm\\\">\\n\\n<h2 class=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface uppercase font-bold\\\">\\n              \\u201cBREATHE COOL, LEARN WELL\\u201d CLASSROOM VENTILATION PROJECT\\n            <\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant\\\">\\n              In response to severe heatwaves affecting Philippine educational institutions, Canriv-J Corporation pledges a percentage of commercial installation proceeds toward outfitting high-density public school classrooms across Pampanga, Tarlac, and Pangasinan with energy-efficient cooling and fresh-air ventilation.\\n            <\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-space-sm pt-space-xs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"p-3 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">142<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Classrooms Equipped<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-3 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">8,500+<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Students Benefited<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"p-3 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-price text-headline-sm text-primary block\\\">100%<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Free Quarterly Servicing<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"pt-space-xs\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold hover:underline\\\">\\n<span>Read our 2025 Luzon Educational Impact Report<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">arrow_forward<\\/span>\\n<\\/span>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"lg:col-span-5 relative\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"h-80 w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\\\">\\n<img alt=\\\"Interior of an air-conditioned classroom in Iloilo, Philippines\\\" class=\\\"w-full h-full object-cover\\\" data-alt=\\\"Interior of an air-conditioned classroom in Iloilo, Philippines\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/upload.wikimedia.org\\/wikipedia\\/commons\\/2\\/2a\\/Interior_of_an_air-conditioned_classroom.jpg\\\"\\/>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\\\">Photo: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/commons.wikimedia.org\\/wiki\\/File:Interior_of_an_air-conditioned_classroom.jpg\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Curpharar \\/ Wikimedia Commons<\\/a> \\u00b7 <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/creativecommons.org\\/licenses\\/by-sa\\/4.0\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-canrivvid1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"canrivvid1\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"c071ae8580656b172dca168c579013a5\\\" data=\\\"eyJpZCI6ImNhbnJpdnZpZDIiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJfdGl0bGUiOiJDYW5yaXYgcHJvamVjdCB2aWRlbyIsImh0bWwiOiIlJUNBTlJJVjpob21lcGFnZS12aWRlbyUlIn0sImVsZW1lbnRzIjpbXSwid2lkZ2V0VHlwZSI6Imh0bWwifQ==\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-0acfdec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"0acfdec\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-888ba4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"888ba4c\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-e-type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"bg-surface text-on-surface font-body-md antialiased\\\"><section class=\\\"w-full bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface py-space-xl\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-gutter\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-lg\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"space-y-space-xs max-w-2xl\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-primary-fixed uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\\\">\\n            DIRECT FACTORY CONTRACTING\\n          <\\/span>\\n<h2 class=\\\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase\\\">\\n            PLAN YOUR HVAC OR ELEVATOR PROJECT\\n          <\\/h2>\\n<p class=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-inverse-on-surface\\/80\\\">\\n            Tell us about your building, the equipment you need, or an HVAC problem you\\u2019re trying to solve. Our team can recommend options and prepare a free quote.\\n          <\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-md\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded bg-primary text-on-primary font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors shadow-md\\\" href=\\\"tel:+639454481254\\\">0945 448 1254<\\/a>\\n<a class=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded bg-surface text-on-surface font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/canriv.free.nf\\/index.php\\/contact\\/\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">calendar_month<\\/span>\\n<span>Book Site Survey<\\/span>\\n<\\/a>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\/div>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-da3dd6c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"da3dd6c\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"c071ae8580656b172dca168c579013a5\\\" data=\\\"eyJpZCI6IjYzZjlhNDMiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJfdGl0bGUiOiJTaXRlIGZvb3RlciIsImh0bWwiOiIlJUNBTlJJVjpmb290ZXIlJSJ9LCJlbGVtZW50cyI6W10sIndpZGdldFR5cGUiOiJodG1sIn0=\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[\"elementor-frontend\"],\"styles\":[]}}'),(1925,18,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(1926,18,'_elementor_css','a:6:{s:4:\"time\";i:1795334834;s:5:\"fonts\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:0:{}s:20:\"dynamic_elements_ids\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:4:\"file\";i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(1927,18,'_elementor_element_cache','{\"timeout\":1795450034,\"value\":{\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-ade97d3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"ade97d3\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"c071ae8580656b172dca168c579013a5\\\" data=\\\"\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-826bfb6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"826bfb6\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\" data-e-type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t[elementor-element k=\\\"c071ae8580656b172dca168c579013a5\\\" data=\\\"eyJpZCI6IjAzYjI1ZGYiLCJlbFR5cGUiOiJ3aWRnZXQiLCJzZXR0aW5ncyI6eyJfdGl0bGUiOiJTaXRlIGZvb3RlciIsImh0bWwiOiIlJUNBTlJJVjpmb290ZXIlJSJ9LCJlbGVtZW50cyI6W10sIndpZGdldFR5cGUiOiJodG1sIn0=\\\"]\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[\"elementor-frontend\"],\"styles\":[]}}');
